('g4-english-adv-1103772b6068', 4, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-in-context', 'mcq', 4, 'nature', 'It is taller than a hill but smaller than the sky. What is it?', null, '["a river","a mountain","a beach","a forest"]', '{"text":"a mountain","index":1}', 'Cao hơn đồi (hill) → núi (mountain). Câu so sánh đoán địa hình.', 'Đoán địa danh từ so sánh.', '{"grade":4,"coreTopic":"nature","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '7d1d2f881da1aa16', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
