('g4-english-adv-2291ca61fb80', 4, 'english', 'reading', 'reading', 'true-false', 5, 'mini-read', 'Read the passage. True or False?', null, '["True","False"]', '{"boolean":false}', 'Bài nói mùa hè ''very busy'' - rất ĐÔNG, ngược với ''quiet and empty''. Đọc cả câu cuối.', 'Đọc chi tiết mô tả mùa du lịch.', '{"grade":4,"coreTopic":"mini-read","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '918b68f9862b402f', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', 'Ha Long Bay has thousands of islands made of stone. The best way to see it is by boat. In summer it is very busy, so book tickets early.', 'Ha Long Bay is quiet and empty in summer.', null),
