('g4-english-adv-309930ec58f9', 4, 'english', 'grammar', 'grammar-use-of-english', 'mcq', 5, 'subject-verb', 'Neither my dad nor my mum ___ coffee in the evening.', null, '["drink","drinks","drinking","is drink"]', '{"text":"drinks","index":1}', 'Với neither/nor, động từ chia theo chủ ngữ GẦN nhất: mum (số ít) → drinks. Quy tắc proximity khó.', 'Hòa hợp chủ-vị gần nhất với neither/nor.', '{"grade":4,"coreTopic":"subject-verb","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '2070119ecd8201ce', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
