('g5-english-adv-16cc203ae844', 5, 'english', 'grammar', 'grammar-use-of-english', 'mcq', 5, 'relative-feel', 'This is the book ___ my teacher gave me.', null, '["who","that","whom","where"]', '{"text":"that","index":1}', '''Book'' là VẬT → dùng ''that'' (hoặc which). ''Who/whom'' chỉ dùng cho người, ''where'' cho nơi chốn.', 'Chọn đại từ quan hệ that cho vật.', '{"grade":5,"coreTopic":"relative-feel","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '518360c518ea1ccc', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g5-english-adv-6ba7d1f70c57', 5, 'english', 'grammar', 'grammar-use-of-english', 'mcq', 5, 'reported-feel', 'He said he ___ tired, so he went to bed early.', null, '["is","was","will be","has been"]', '{"text":"was","index":1}', 'Câu tường thuật quá khứ: said + was (lùi thì). ''Is'' sai vì câu chính đã quá khứ.', 'Lùi thì trong câu tường thuật đơn giản.', '{"grade":5,"coreTopic":"reported-feel","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'b7bfdf78e65088b4', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g5-english-adv-a6d88d6f879a', 5, 'english', 'reading', 'reading', 'true-false', 5, 'mini-read', 'Read the passage. True or False?', null, '["True","False"]', '{"boolean":false}', 'Bài nói ''only 1,000 visitors each year'' - GIỚI HẠN số lượng, không phải ai cũng vào được bất cứ lúc nào.', 'Đọc hiểu giới hạn trong bài về địa danh nổi tiếng.', '{"grade":5,"coreTopic":"mini-read","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '32e2d226edc2fab8', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', 'Son Doong is the biggest cave in the world. It is in Quang Binh province. Inside, there are rivers, forests and even clouds. Only 1,000 visitors can enter each year.', 'Anyone can visit Son Doong at any time.', null),
('g5-english-adv-522b1a2fd8f6', 5, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-in-context', 'mcq', 5, 'city-life', 'In a big city, rush hour is when ___.', null, '["everyone sleeps","traffic is heaviest - morning and evening","shops close early","it starts raining"]', '{"text":"traffic is heaviest - morning and evening","index":1}', 'Rush hour = giờ cao điểm, giao thông đông nhất sáng và chiều. Từ vựng đời sống đô thị.', 'Hiểu thuật ngữ rush hour.', '{"grade":5,"coreTopic":"city-life","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'd5d19c4378de59b9', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g5-english-adv-72ea3677bcb1', 5, 'english', 'grammar', 'grammar-use-of-english', 'mcq', 5, 'should', 'You ___ cheat in the exam. It is wrong and you learn nothing.', null, '["should","should not","must to","ought"]', '{"text":"should not","index":1}', 'Gian lận là SAI → should not (không nên). ''Must to'' sai cấu trúc - must + V không to.', 'Khuyên không nên làm việc sai với should not.', '{"grade":5,"coreTopic":"should","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '36d8f555d474ecb7', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g5-english-adv-6a54e1098792', 5, 'english', 'communication', 'functional-language', 'mcq', 5, 'congratulations', 'Your friend won first prize in the English contest. You say: "___"', null, '["Better luck next time.","Congratulations! You worked so hard!","It was just luck.","I wanted that prize."]', '{"text":"Congratulations! You worked so hard!","index":1}', 'Bạn thắng giải → chúc mừng: ''Congratulations!'' ''Better luck next time'' dùng khi THUA.', 'Chúc mừng thành tích đúng tình huống.', '{"grade":5,"coreTopic":"congratulations","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'e7365c8589bf15eb', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g5-english-adv-b103565f849e', 5, 'english', 'grammar', 'grammar-use-of-english', 'mcq', 5, 'quantifiers', 'There are ___ students in the hall - I counted over five hundred!', null, '["a few","a little","lots of","much"]', '{"text":"lots of","index":2}', '500 học sinh = NHIỀU → lots of (đếm được số nhiều). ''A few'' là ít, ''much/a little'' không đếm được.', 'Chọn lượng từ cho danh từ đếm được số lượng lớn.', '{"grade":5,"coreTopic":"quantifiers","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'fc648cca28f4ea0e', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g5-english-adv-fdff48534a16', 5, 'english', 'writing', 'writing', 'reorder', 5, 'word-order', 'Rearrange the words to make a correct sentence.', null, null, '{"text":"If it is sunny tomorrow, we will play outside."}', 'Điều kiện loại 1: If + hiện tại đơn, will + V ở vế chính. ''If it is sunny tomorrow, we will play outside.'' - 10 từ khó.', 'Sắp xếp câu điều kiện loại 1 hoàn chỉnh.', '{"grade":5,"coreTopic":"word-order","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'f1612a83a0387ea7', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, '["If","it","sunny","is","tomorrow","we","will","play","outside","."]'),
('g5-english-adv-4eab6ba4191c', 5, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-in-context', 'mcq', 4, 'technology', 'You can use this device to call friends, play games and take photos. What is it?', null, '["a television","a smartphone","a radio","a camera"]', '{"text":"a smartphone","index":1}', 'Gọi điện + chơi game + chụp ảnh = điện thoại thông minh (smartphone). Camera không gọi được.', 'Đoán thiết bị từ 3 chức năng.', '{"grade":5,"coreTopic":"technology","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '5719ac99dbaa6586', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
