('g2-english-adv-37abd57b0096', 2, 'english', 'reading', 'reading', 'true-false', 4, 'mini-read', 'Read the passage. True or False?', null, '["True","False"]', '{"boolean":true}', 'Bài nói ''a big bowl on the teacher''s desk'' - bể cá đặt trên bàn cô → đúng là sống ở bàn cô (trong bể).', 'Đọc chi tiết vị trí trong bài.', '{"grade":2,"coreTopic":"mini-read","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'd72c5494d303a5b3', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', 'Our class has a pet. It is a goldfish. It lives in a big bowl on the teacher''s desk. We feed it every morning.', 'The goldfish lives on the teacher''s desk.', null),
