('g1-math-adv-2bfb1bcee268', 1, 'math', 'number', 'number-sense', 'mcq', 4, 'comparison', 'Which is the BIGGEST number?', null, '["seventeen","seven","seventy","ten"]', '{"text":"seventy","index":2}', 'Seventy = 70, lớn hơn seventeen (17), ten (10) và seven (7). ''Seventy'' và ''seventeen'' dễ nhầm vì đọc gần giống.', 'So sánh các số trong phạm vi 100 bằng tên tiếng Anh.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"comparison","moetSubject":"Mathematics","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '6b47a2f7af263e9f', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-math-adv-867b674c3c58', 1, 'math', 'number', 'number-sense', 'mcq', 4, 'comparison', 'Which is the SMALLEST number?', null, '["twelve","twenty","two","ten"]', '{"text":"two","index":2}', 'Two = 2, nhỏ nhất trong 4 số. ''Twelve'' (12) và ''twenty'' (20) là nhiễu hay nhầm.', 'So sánh các số bằng tên tiếng Anh.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"comparison","moetSubject":"Mathematics","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'd317be4e4cf67e1a', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-math-adv-d8b2a535f806', 1, 'math', 'geometry', 'geometry', 'mcq', 4, 'shapes', 'A triangle has 3 sides. How many sides do TWO triangles have together?', null, '["5","6","7","9"]', '{"text":"6","index":1}', 'Mỗi tam giác có 3 cạnh, 2 tam giác có 3 + 3 = 6 cạnh. Câu hỏi 2 bước: hiểu hình rồi tính.', 'Vận dụng đặc điểm hình học vào phép tính.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"shapes","moetSubject":"Mathematics","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'eb2556b343e92392', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
