('g1-math-adv-c17db897f19c', 1, 'math', 'problem-solving', 'mathematical-reasoning', 'mcq', 4, 'patterns', 'Look at the numbers: 10, 9, 8, 7, ___. What comes next?', null, '["5","6","8","11"]', '{"text":"6","index":1}', 'Dãy đếm lùi 1: sau 7 là 6. Nhiễu 5 bỏ qua 6; 8 là đếm xuôi.', 'Nhận diện dãy số đếm lùi.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"patterns","moetSubject":"Mathematics","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '7c7706302ef2e06f', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-math-adv-a26c219c1766', 1, 'math', 'problem-solving', 'problem-solving', 'mcq', 4, 'word-problems', 'Lan has 6 balloons. She gives 2 to Hoa and 1 to Minh. How many balloons does Lan have left?', null, '["3","4","5","9"]', '{"text":"3","index":0}', 'Cho đi tổng cộng 2 + 1 = 3 bóng, còn 6 - 3 = 3. Bài toán 2 bước.', 'Giải bài toán trừ hai bước.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"word-problems","moetSubject":"Mathematics","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'aca2858ecf4e5ed5', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
