('g3-math-adv-a22b770d5979', 3, 'math', 'problem-solving', 'problem-solving', 'mcq', 4, 'word-problems', 'A pack has 8 crayons. Teacher buys 6 packs for the class. How many crayons are there in all?', null, '["14","42","48","68"]', '{"text":"48","index":2}', '8 x 6 = 48 bút màu. Nhiễu 14 là 8+6; 68 ghép hai số - đều sai.', 'Nhân có lời văn một bước.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"word-problems","moetSubject":"Mathematics","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'eb32fba90310bb80', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
