('g2-science-adv-a2e29e2ec8b7', 2, 'science', 'earth', 'science-concept', 'mcq', 4, 'seasons', 'Leaves fall from the trees and the weather gets cooler. Which season is it?', null, '["spring","summer","autumn","winter"]', '{"text":"autumn","index":2}', 'Lá rụng + trời mát dần = mùa thu (autumn). Mùa đông lạnh hơn nữa và nhiều cây đã trụi lá.', 'Nhận diện đặc điểm các mùa.', '{"grade":2,"coreTopic":"seasons","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '3a6bf6fe570a69ac', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
