('g3-science-adv-c9457b999723', 3, 'science', 'living-things', 'science-reasoning', 'mcq', 4, 'plants', 'Two same plants are planted. One is put in sunlight, one in a dark cupboard. After one week, the plant in the dark is ___.', null, '["taller and healthier","the same as the other","weak and pale","full of flowers"]', '{"text":"weak and pale","index":2}', 'Cây thiếu sáng không quang hợp được nên yếu, nhợt nhạt (pale). Đây là thí nghiệm kinh điển về ánh sáng.', 'Dự đoán kết quả thí nghiệm cây thiếu ánh sáng.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"plants","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'bd88e84940fedcba', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
